cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this collection, cite it and the source paper of each skill you use (provenance.source_papers
  in every SKILL.md).
title: ASB Metabolomics Skill Collection
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-metabolomics
url: https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-metabolomics
abstract: 'Curated, evidence-grounded skill and software-tool collection for computational mass-spectrometry-based
  metabolomics (LC-MS/MS, LC-MS, GC-MS, mass-spectrometry imaging, ion mobility, lipidomics, with some
  NMR), generated by the AgenticScienceBuilder (ASB) pipeline from published method papers (journal articles and
  preprints) and their public code repositories. Each skill is anchored to verbatim evidence from its source paper, annotated
  with EDAM (Metabolomics) and gated for licensing and personal data before release; the source paper
  of every skill is cited in its provenance block (provenance.source_papers) and must be cited alongside the collection. Released
  by the Holobiomics Lab (CNRS / Université Côte d''Azur). Source repositories: collection - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skills-metabolomics;
  registry and tooling - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skill-collections; generating pipeline
  - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/AgenticScienceBuilder. Licence: collection content CC-BY-4.0; code
  Apache-2.0; verbatim quotes under quotation right (LICENSING.md).'
keywords:
- metabolomics
- mass spectrometry
- LC-MS/MS
- LC-MS
- GC-MS
- NMR
- mass spectrometry imaging
- ion mobility
- lipidomics
- scientific agents
